WEBVTT

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.080
Nobunaga-sama!

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:26.390
Ranmaru.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:27.840
Be silent.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:29.840
I know.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:32.720
Mitsuhide...

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:17.680
Hey, are you okay?

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.970
Are you alive?

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.170
What's going on here?

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.330
Hamburgers

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:36.860
Oda Nobunaga?

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:41.650
You sure don't look it.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:42.530
What do you mean?

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:45.600
I am clearly none other than the

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:48.660
Sweet Little Devil, King Oda Nobunaga.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.040
Yeah, I dunno...

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:53.280
You don't look anything 
like the Nobunaga I know.

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:55.460
The Nobunaga you know?

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.630
So what?

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.100
You ever meet this Nobunaga?

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.210
You guys BFFs?

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:02.260
Maybe it's your cousin or something?

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.690
It's not like that...

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:05.970
That's what I thought.

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:08.350
The Nobunaga in front of 
you is far more likely

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.080
to be the real Nobunaga

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:12.480
than some Nobunaga you've never met.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:14.890
<i>What's with this girl?</i>

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:17.520
<i>Did she hurt her head in that fall?</i>

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:20.310
<i>Regardless, she doesn't look hurt,</i>

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:23.490
<i>so it's probably best that 
I don't get too involved.</i>

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.200
What is this?

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:29.500
It's a hamburger, what else?

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.270
A ham-barger?

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.850
A hamburger.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.760
You've had one before, right?

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:38.660
So... this is food?

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:39.210
Yup.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:41.760
They're pretty good.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.220
You're lying!

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.890
It's all dry and nasty!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.470
Not like that.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:51.340
You eat it together like this.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:02.740
This isn't half bad!

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.590
Jeez... You don't even 
know what a hamburger is?

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:07.450
What kind of spoiled rich girl are you?

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:11.240
<i>Oh crap!</i>

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:13.510
I've gotta get to work.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:15.460
Wait!

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:16.760
I haven't finished my ham-barger!

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.370
<b>Oota</b>

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:28.390
Thank you.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.920
What was with that girl?

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:37.540
Welcome.

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:41.830
There you are.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:42.940
I've been looking for you.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.360
You've been looking for me? Why?

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:49.920
Because you're my retainer.

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:52.910
Your retainer?  Why?

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.540
Because I don't have a choice.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.210
I was thrust into this weird place,

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.730
and for the moment, it feels like

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:01.330
you're the only one I 
can communicate with.

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:05.960
I don't know if you could really 
call this communication...

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:09.860
Anyway, I want to know 
more about this world.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:12.060
Show me around.

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:13.760
What are you talking about?

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.450
I'm at work right now.

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:18.070
Work? What's that?

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:20.800
Work, a job, employment.

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:22.210
I am working now.

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:25.480
Listen to me!

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:27.740
<b>Rice Balls</b>

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:32.360
All the rest of this is new 
to me, but this I know!

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:36.190
Time to eat!

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.750
What is this?!

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.030
Don't eat without paying!

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:44.110
What's with this thing?

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:45.250
I can't eat this!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.030
Don't eat it!

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:49.720
There're so many here, 
does it honestly matter?

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.240
They're for sale!

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:52.720
If you want to eat something, 
then pay for it.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:56.160
Oh, if it costs money, 
you should've just told me.

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:57.630
So you have money.

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:58.310
Nope.

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.530
So how are you going to pay for it?

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:00.980
You're going to do something about it.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:02.270
Why?

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:03.230
Because you're my retainer.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:10.820
Inari Sushi 3 Pack

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:14.550
I'm gonna be stuck with 
this nuisance, aren't I?

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:15.440
Jeez, what a pain!

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:16.640
Don't move!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.460
Is my whole day going to be like this?

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:24.250
Hand over the money!

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.010
What's your problem?

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:28.030
You've just shown up and 
you're being very rude.

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:29.510
So are you...

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:31.990
Can't you see this?

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:34.040
Of course I can see it.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.290
What I'm not sure about is, 
why I'm supposed to care.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:38.520
Quit screwing around!

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.390
You're the one who's 
screwing around here.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.410
Listen up.

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:43.740
This is his shop.

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:46.210
No, I just work here.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:47.960
It doesn't actually belong to me.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.580
Then all the more reason!

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:51.400
Take a good, long look at him!

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:54.660
His scraggly, worn clothing!

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:57.260
His dejected, tired face!

00:07:58.030 --> 00:07:59.960
You can tell just by looking,

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:01.990
that the rest of his life is going 
to be miserable, can't you?

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:07.670
This pathetic man is working here 
in order to earn a mere pittance.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:09.680
For you to burst in and 
steal what paltry savings

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:11.130
are kept here is simply unthinkable!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:13.220
As unthinkable as a Doudantsutsuji bush!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.840
Its flowers are white 
and its leaves are red!

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:21.260
Well, I'm sure you're hard up, too.

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:24.640
But why not try for something bigger?

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:26.560
B-Bigger?

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.230
Conquer your neighbors and 
unite Japan under your rule.

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:33.750
How could you do anything else?

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:36.460
You got any balls down there?

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:54.880
Thank you for your help.

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:58.390
Man, you've got guts.

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:01.280
You didn't shake at all when 
you had a gun pointed at you.

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:03.390
You must really be Nobunaga.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:04.890
Of course I am.

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:08.490
Those things only hit you when 
you think they're gonna hit you.

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:09.850
If you think they won't hit you,

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:11.640
there's nothing to be scared of at all.

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:15.650
No, at that range it would've hit...

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:21.160
A lot happened today.  I'm tired.

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:26.180
Why are you following me home?

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:27.210
You're my retainer.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.300
Why else?

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:31.130
You know how they say owing 
somebody for a meal and a bed?

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:34.160
You've given me a meal,

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:36.930
so you need to let me 
stay at your place, too.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:41.350
D-Debt... Debt... Debt of a meal.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:42.390
There it is.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.970
What's it say?

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:46.190
An old custom whereby 
allowing a traveler

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.650
to stay with you and feeding them

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:50.110
a meal putting them deeply within your debt.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:52.400
That's not what it means at all!

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:53.360
Hey!

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:56.870
W-W-What are you doing?

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:57.840
Bath.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.930
I'm going to take a bath.

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.030
Get it ready.

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:11.040
Why do I have to watch Oda Nobunaga 
take her clothes off?

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:20.470
Why are you taking your clothes off?

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:23.060
Because I'm going to take a bath.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:25.820
But you don't have to take 
them off here, do you?

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.020
Why not?

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.560
Why not?  Well, um...

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:32.310
If you've got something 
you want to say, say it.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:33.820
If you don't say anything, 
I'll take my clothes off.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:36.560
It's a problem...

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:37.700
Why?

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:39.820
Because I can see you!

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:42.240
Then don't look.

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:57.910
This is great.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:03.220
"A girl fell from the sky 
and now she's in my bath..."

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:07.220
No, this is impossible.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.140
You can wear that for now.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.850
You must be hungry, right?

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:28.750
Let's eat.

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:38.920
Let's eat.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:43.680
This is good.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.120
Is it?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.310
I eat it all the time, so you know...

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:56.610
There's only room for 
one person in the bed.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:58.620
I can see that.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.030
You can sleep on the floor.

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:09.530
Yeah.

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:26.080
A minke and a blue whale...

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:27.640
Wake up!

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:31.810
W-What is it?

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.530
How long were you planning 
on sleeping, fool?

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:37.150
How long?

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:39.610
It's only six...

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.900
What do you even want to do 
this early in the morning?

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:45.160
There's lots of stuff to do.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:46.930
First our morning strategy conference.

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:49.120
Then meetings with messengers 
from all over the land.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.440
And then...

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.250
Oh, right.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:55.120
In this world I'm...

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.600
Hey, are you okay?

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:00.670
I know how you feel, 
but getting depressed won't—

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:02.050
All right!

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:04.550
Getting depressed won't help.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.170
I'll start by doing what I can.

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:13.520
Let's eat.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.010
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:19.520
<i>it's been ages since 
I've eaten a meal here</i>

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:21.020
<i>with someone like this...</i>

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:26.800
<i>It's been a long time since we broke up.</i>

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:33.410
<i>She barely even used her helmet.</i>

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:35.750
Hey,

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:37.700
if you don't have anything to do,

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:39.460
want to go out for a while?

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:42.830
Hang on tight.

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:43.800
All right.

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.850
Hey, don't cling to me so tightly!

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:51.360
Huh? You're the one who 
said to hold on tightly.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.650
Well, I did, but...

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:55.600
Anyway, let's go.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:56.640
Okay!

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.700
Hey, they're getting ahead of us!

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.180
Go faster!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.150
Okay!

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.060
Go!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:10.130
<i>And we come together, and the warmth...</i>

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:14.090
There're lots of interesting 
things in this world.

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:15.390
Yeah?

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:17.830
I don't really think so.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:21.150
I love rare things and strange things.

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:24.010
That's why I made you my retainer.

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:25.900
You should be honored.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.150
Thanks.

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:33.850
The sea!

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:45.460
Here.

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:47.540
What is this?

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:48.710
Ice cream.

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:50.680
There was a stand selling it over there,

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:52.580
and it brought back memories.

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:54.630
It's good, try it.

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:02.860
This is great!

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:03.730
Isn't it?

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:07.650
It's strange.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:10.010
Something that brings 
back memories for you

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:12.700
feels brand new to me.

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:44.810
What do you think?

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.140
I found something nice.

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:48.870
This is diamond, isn't it?

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:52.390
These curves, the way it 
feels in your hand...

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:55.230
It must be the work of a master.

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:57.030
No, that's...

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.420
You can't have it.

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:01.580
If you want a reward, 
then go get the first kill in battle.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:06.390
By the way, what were you doing?

00:17:06.390 --> 00:17:08.830
Making a castle.  A castle.

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:10.960
My castle's a hundreds of times,

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:13.470
or even a thousands of times more...

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.890
That's right.

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.350
Now I don't...

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:25.970
You want to go back to your old world?

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:27.350
Of course I do.

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:30.880
I had almost conquered the whole land.

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.860
Of course I want to go back.

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:35.270
Yeah, I'm sure.

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:39.840
But I don't think this 
place is that bad.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:41.040
You know?

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:44.100
There are all kinds of rare 
things and delicious things.

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:45.910
Yeah.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.670
That ice cream was good.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:49.880
Right?

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:58.780
If you want to stay here, 
it's okay with me...

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:08.960
Stop! Stop! Stop!

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:16.370
Hey, what's wrong?

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:29.160
I'm surprised.

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:30.040
At what?

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:33.860
You didn't seem the type for prayer.

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:36.060
I wouldn't if there was any other way.

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:38.780
But if prayer is my only shot,

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:40.010
it's better than nothing.

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.550
So what did you ask for?

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:46.310
To go back to my old world.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.240
I see.

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:50.240
And I told them that if 
they didn't grant my wish,

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:53.320
I'd tear down the 
shrine and set it ablaze.

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:54.570
How violent.

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:56.250
What do we do?  What do we do?

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:58.990
She said she'd burn it down!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:01.120
OK, then...

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:10.620
Maybe it's okay if I stay here.

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:12.670
Did you say something?

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:14.540
Nothing!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.950
Just get us home.

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:18.670
Right, right.

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:21.680
And we're back.

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:24.330
I'm tired, so I'm going to bed.

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:31.570
Nobunaga-sama!

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:33.760
Nobunaga-sama!

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:56.300
Who are you?

00:19:56.900 --> 00:19:59.350
We exist throughout all time and space.

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:00.550
The Fox Miko.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:01.810
The Cat Miko.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:03.800
The Rabbit Miko.

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:08.800
We have heard your prayer 
and decided to answer it.

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:12.230
We don't want you burning 
down our shrine.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:17.120
Then you'll send me back 
to my world, right?

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:17.820
Yes.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:21.730
But to do that, we require 
a great deal of power.

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:23.920
To gain that power,

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.450
you need to gather the Secret Treasures.

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:26.990
Secret Treasures?

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:34.940
Yes, the Secret Treasures 
are spheres of power,

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:37.070
created in the hearts of 
ambitious warriors

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:38.800
during the Age of Warring States.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:43.840
Other warriors, besides yourself, 
have come to this world.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.800
There's a lot!

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:50.090
Seek them out and gather 
the Secret Treasures.

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:55.060
Your treasure will tell 
you where the others are.

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:04.070
All right.

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:06.880
If I find the others

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:08.770
and plunder their treasures,

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:10.440
then you can use that power

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:14.040
to send me back to my world, right?

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:15.600
Yes.

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:17.080
Well...

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:23.130
Okay!  I'll do it!

00:21:43.470 --> 00:21:45.720
She's gone, huh?

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:55.120
<b>Reward</b>

00:21:56.800 --> 00:21:59.990
A debt of a meal and a bed, huh?

00:23:45.510 --> 00:23:48.440
Hey, how can you start 
the show without me?

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:51.810
The star of the next episode 
is me, Tokugawa Ieyasu.

00:23:51.810 --> 00:23:54.720
She's cute, but she's also pretty gutsy.

00:23:54.720 --> 00:23:56.460
Next time on Sengoku Collection:

00:23:56.460 --> 00:23:57.850
"Peaceful Empress"

00:23:57.850 --> 00:23:59.810
If you don't watch it 
I'll kick your ass!
